}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Get Full Volunteer Detail
  
  Retrieves the complete detail of a single volunteer registration by its unique identifier. Returns all personal information, volunteer preferences, ASH-specific details, and consent/administrative fields.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires 'read' permission
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                              |
  |-----------|--------|----------|------------------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the volunteer registration       |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the complete volunteer registration record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": { ... }
  }
  ```
  
  ### Response Fields (`data`)
  
  | Field                      | Type     | Description                                                        |
  |----------------------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | id                         | string   | UUID primary key.                                                  |
  | firstName                  | string   | Volunteer's first name.                                            |
  | middleName                 | string   | Volunteer's middle name (nullable).                                |
  | surname                    | string   | Volunteer's surname.                                               |
  | gender                     | string   | Volunteer's gender (`MALE` or `FEMALE`).                           |
  | dob                        | string   | Date of birth (`YYYY-MM-DD`).                                      |
  | age                        | number   | Volunteer's age (≥ 16).                                            |
  | phoneNumber                | string   | Phone number.                                                      |
  | emailAddress               | string   | Email address.                                                     |
  | homeAddress                | string   | Home address.                                                      |
  | city                       | string   | City of residence.                                                 |
  | state                      | string   | State of residence.                                                |
  | occupation                 | string   | Occupation (nullable).                                             |
  | highestEducation           | string   | Highest level of education (nullable).                             |
  | reasonForVolunteering      | string   | Reason for volunteering.                                           |
  | volunteerAreas             | string[] | Areas the volunteer is interested in.                              |
  | skillsToContribute         | string[] | Skills the volunteer can contribute (nullable).                    |
  | availability               | string[] | Availability schedule.                                             |
  | commitmentDuration         | string   | Desired commitment duration (nullable).                            |
  | ashSaturdayAvailability    | string   | Availability for ASH Saturday sessions (nullable).                 |
  | ashAcademicArea            | string   | Academic area for ASH support (nullable).                          |
  | ashExtracurricular         | string[] | Extracurricular activities for ASH (nullable).                     |
  | safeguardingAgreement      | string   | Safeguarding agreement acknowledgement.                            |
  | mediaConsent               | boolean  | Whether media consent was given.                                   |
  | additionalInfo             | string   | Additional information (nullable).                                 |
  | status                     | string   | Registration status (`pending`, `accepted`, `rejected`).           |
  | updatedAt                  | string   | ISO 8601 timestamp of last update (nullable).                      |
  | createdAt                  | string   | ISO 8601 timestamp of record creation.                             |
  | deletedAt                  | string   | ISO 8601 soft-delete timestamp (nullable).                         |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                             |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID).             |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                |
}
